sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 浏览器
    participant MW as Middlewares
    participant Router as Router
    participant Controller as BookController
    participant Query as BookQueryService
    participant Command as BookCommandService
    participant Repo as EbookRepository
    participant DB as SQLite

    Note over Client,DB: GET /api/books (查询)
    Client->>MW: GET /api/books
    MW->>Router: 路由匹配
    Router->>Controller: listBooks(ctx)
    Controller->>Query: getBookList()
    Query->>Repo: findAll()
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM ebooks
    DB-->>Repo: 原始数据
    Repo-->>Query: [Ebook模型]
    Query->>Query: 转换为DTO
    Query-->>Controller: [BookDTO]
    Controller-->>MW: ctx.body = data
    MW->>MW: 包装为 {code,data,msg}
    MW-->>Client: 200 JSON

    Note over Client,DB: POST /api/books (写入)
    Client->>MW: POST /api/books {bookName}
    MW->>Router: 路由匹配
    Router->>Controller: createBook(ctx)
    Controller->>Command: createBook(bookDTO)
    Command->>Command: 业务校验
    Command->>Repo: create(rawData)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO ebooks
    DB-->>Repo: 新记录
    Repo-->>Command: 新Entity
    Command-->>Controller: {id, bookName}
    Controller-->>MW: ctx.status=201, body=data
    MW->>MW: 包装为 {code,data,msg}
    MW-->>Client: 201 JSON
